#X text 240 83 Both I²C and SPI connections are supported. The I²C
connection is not fast.;
#X text 240 123 Note: you should send the [flush( message to transfer
the internal pixel buffer to the device.;
#X text 240 163 Typical use cases:;
#X text 250 188 • Compact status and info display — showing tempo \,
mode \, preset names or other short text on a small OLED screen \,
drawn with the text and pixel methods.;
#X text 250 243 • Graphical and bitmap output — drawing custom images
\, icons or animated bitmaps using the write bitmap and write bytes
methods \, for example for a small menu \, level meter or visualizer.;
